{"content":[{"c":["JASHOBEAM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Zabdiel’s son who was put in charge of David’s “Three” mightiest men (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.11","r":"1Chr.11.11","rawR":"1Chr.11.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.11","value":"1Chr.11.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:11"},") and also appointed chief of a division (24,000 soldiers) on duty in the first month of the year (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.2","r":"1Chr.27.2","rawR":"1Chr.27.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.2","value":"1Chr.27.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:2"},"). He is the same person as Josheb-basshebeth, the Tahkemonite (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.8","r":"2Sam.23.8","rawR":"2Sam.23.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.8","value":"2Sam.23.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:8"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg). Jashobeam gained renown by killing 300 men, according to ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.11","r":"1Chr.11.11","rawR":"1Chr.11.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.11","value":"1Chr.11.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 11:11"},", or 800, according to ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.8","r":"2Sam.23.8","rawR":"2Sam.23.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.8","value":"2Sam.23.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 23:8"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the ambidextrous warriors who joined David at Ziklag (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.6","r":"1Chr.12.6","rawR":"1Chr.12.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.6","value":"1Chr.12.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:6"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jashobeam","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.11"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.2","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.2","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.2"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.8","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.8","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 11:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.11"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 23:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.8","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.8","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.6","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.6","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.6"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8972c2fffe4d24d3d6da42239ebe4e69439bbca2a9b28395f64a8959c2227cae","sourceItemName":"Jashobeam","sourceItemOrder":102,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jashobeam","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jashobeam","title":"Jashobeam","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}